Consider the following program:<br><pre><code>
int main()
{
  f1();
  f2(2);
  f3();
  return(0);
}

int f1()
{
  return(1);
}

int f2(int X)
{
  f3();
  if (X==1)
     return f1();
  else
     return (X*f2(X-1));
}

int f3()
{
  return(5);
}

</code></pre><br>Which one of the following options represents the activation tree corresponding to
the main function?<br><img src="/wp-content/uploads/GATE/CS/20231/q26.jpg" /><br>

